\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $12{x}_{i}^{2}+19{y}_{j}^{2}+3.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345079 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179668 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f" :knowledge-point/title "Writing an Upper Riemann Sum for a Strictly Decreasing Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5ea618ab-8cfc-5b6a-830e-0e4d5384b74d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "35-3{x}_{i-1}-9{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343036} {:answer/id #uuid "601a4d42-f321-5a42-9cb3-bc3cfe5f5532" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "35-3{x}_{i-1}-9{y}_{j}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343054} {:answer/id #uuid "84326603-f535-5a7d-83f9-ed0fe755c834" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i}+3{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343369} {:answer/id #uuid "b32ef213-5a72-5e98-8c9d-8d633f006778" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}_{i-1}+3{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343810} {:answer/id #uuid "d2a7f258-2049-56ed-bfb5-45f8abd81c55" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "35-3{x}_{i}-9{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186344085}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ea618ab-8cfc-5b6a-830e-0e4d5384b74d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "35-3{x}_{i-1}-9{y}_{j-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186343036} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a22577e-c3ef-54b7-9da9-209afaa2cf69" :answer-fiel